 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "DiskBlockManager(n, maximumCycles) creates blocks 0..n-1, each with maximumCycles remaining writes. write() chooses, among blocks with at least one remaining write, the one with the fewest remaining writes, ties broken by the smallest id; it uses one write of that block and returns its id, or returns -1 when every block is worn out. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
